{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-08-24 15:15:00', 'title': 'PHOTO RELEASE — HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES NAMES BROOKE HART AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, COMMUNICATIONS', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., AUG. 24, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES (NYSE: HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT BROOKE HART HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, COMMUNICATIONS. HART WILL SUCCEED JERRI DICKSESKI, WHO WILL RETIRE ON SEPT. 1 AFTER NEARLY 31 YEARS OF SERVICE.'}